# a quad facing +Z in two groups of the same material, its UVs all on one
# line across the texture (u 0.125 to 0.875 at v 0.5), as in a palette model.
# Two groups make the Mesh bake its material colors into vertexColors.
mtllib palette.mtl
v -0.5 -0.5 0
v 0.5 -0.5 0
v 0.5 0.5 0
v -0.5 0.5 0
vt 0.125 0.5
vt 0.875 0.5
usemtl palette
f 1/1 2/2 3/2
usemtl palette
f 1/1 3/2 4/1
